Package: type-as-you-speak
Maintainer: Faizal Sahebdin <iller7@gmail.com>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/iller7/type-as-you-speak
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ydotool, wl-clipboard, xclip, ffmpeg
Description: type-as-you-speak dictation for Linux (Wayland & X11)
 Speak, and your words are typed into the focused window in real time.
 .
 Type As You Speak is dictation, not transcription: it is an input method,
 like a keyboard. Everything runs on your machine (faster-whisper), so your
 audio never leaves it and it works offline after the first model download.
